ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXinxin wants to go to her friend's party tonight, but she has a stomachache. She knows, if she tells her mother she has a stomachache, her mother does not let her go. She tries to hide her feelings, so her mother lets her go to the party.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xinxin seem happy on the surface?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Because her mother agrees to her attending the party\nB. Because her mother understands her situation.\nC. To avoid her mother not letting her attend the party\nD. Because she tells her mother the truth that she has a stomachache, she does not lie to her mother.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0075766797816014045,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e1aed6006945d2800226","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794367918189,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:31:58","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"884ef14921044d66ba1265d2542a68de"}